  <diagram name="Page-1" id="iSR_4HA_lnERe0poOedq">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1813" dy="883" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="1000" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant Client as Client App\n    participant Controller as ProjectsController\n    participant Service as ProjectsService\n    participant Entity as project:Project\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB\n    participant Logger as Async Logger Service\n\n    Note over User, Logger: Part 1: Project Creation (Create, Guard, Sync, Async)\n    User-&gt;&gt;Client: Submit New Project Data\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: validateFormInputs()\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: POST /api/projects [tokenValid == true]\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: createProject(userId, dto)\n    \n    %% Create Message\n    create participant Entity\n    Service-&gt;&gt;Entity: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; new Project(name, colorCode)\n    \n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO projects VALUES(...)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Return Created Entity\n    \n    %% Asynchronous Message (fire &amp; forget non-blocking log)\n    Service-)Logger: logActivityAsync(\&quot;PROJECT_CREATED\&quot;)\n    \n    Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Return Project DTO\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: 201 Created (JSON)\n    Client--&gt;&gt;User: Display New Project in Sidebar\n\n    Note over User, Logger: Part 2: Project Update (Edit)\n    User-&gt;&gt;Client: Submit Updated Project Data\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: validateFormInputs()\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: PUT /api/projects/:id [tokenValid == true &amp;&amp; isOwner == true]\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: updateProject(userId, projectId, dto)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;Entity: updateFields(name, colorCode, description)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE projects SET ... WHERE id = projectId\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Return Updated Entity\n    \n    %% Asynchronous Message (fire &amp; forget non-blocking log)\n    Service-)Logger: logActivityAsync(\&quot;PROJECT_UPDATED\&quot;)\n    \n    Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Return Updated Project DTO\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (JSON)\n    Client--&gt;&gt;User: Update Project Card in Sidebar\n\n    Note over User, Logger: Part 3: Project Deletion (Delete / Destroy)\n    User-&gt;&gt;Client: Click Delete Project\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: DELETE /api/projects/:id [isOwner == true]\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: deleteProject(userId, projectId)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: DELETE FROM projects WHERE id = projectId\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: 200 OK (Confirmed)\n    \n    %% Delete Message (Destroys Object)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;Entity: destroyObject()\n    destroy Entity\n    \n    Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Return Success Status\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK\n    Client--&gt;&gt;User: Remove Project Card from UI&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="n9pc1Qv4JgFBd5wCC1IJ-1">
